{"watch":21,"start":6000,"events":[{"seq":1009,"t":6000,"type":"watch","watch":21},{"seq":1010,"t":6000,"type":"model","house":"rhino","model":"local:local","tokens":1870,"retries":0},{"seq":1011,"t":6000,"type":"thought","house":"rhino","text":"It is Watch 21. Doctrine suggests taking the middle ford (F2) in the first five watches and holding it. I have rhino-inf-1 and rhino-arch-1 near NONG VILLAGE/N-MID area, and rhino-inf-2 at F2 (though old). I should reinforce F2 and try to control the center. Tiger has units at F1"},{"seq":1012,"t":6000,"type":"courier","id":"c346","house":"rhino","letter":"L405","kind":"order","to":"rhino-inf-1","path":["rhino-camp","north-village","n-mid"],"depart":6000,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, MARCH TO MIDDLE FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":1013,"t":6000,"type":"courier","id":"c347","house":"rhino","letter":"L406","kind":"order","to":"rhino-arch-1","path":["rhino-camp","north-village","n-mid"],"depart":6000,"plain":"BOWMEN, MARCH TO MIDDLE FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":1014,"t":6000,"type":"model","house":"kite","model":"local:local","tokens":1566,"retries":0},{"seq":1015,"t":6000,"type":"thought","house":"kite","text":"It is Watch 21. Doctrine dictates taking the east crossing (F3) early. My forces are at F3 (East Ford). I must maintain presence and reinforce F3. I will use a cipher to signal intent to hold F3 strongly."},{"seq":1016,"t":6000,"type":"courier","id":"c348","house":"kite","letter":"L407","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-1","path":["kite-camp","n-east","F3"],"depart":6000,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT EAST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":1017,"t":6000,"type":"courier","id":"c349","house":"kite","letter":"L408","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-2","path":["kite-camp","n-east","F3"],"depart":6000,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, HOLD AT EAST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":1018,"t":6000,"type":"model","house":"orchid","model":"local:local","tokens":1722,"retries":0},{"seq":1019,"t":6000,"type":"thought","house":"orchid","text":"Rhino and Tiger have forces near